    <h2>DQ Premium Fruit Smoothies — Real Fruit, No Artificial Colors</h2>
  <p>DQ's Premium Fruit Smoothies use real fruit purees without artificial colors or flavors. They are blended to a thick, smooth consistency — thicker than a juice but thinner than a milkshake. At $3.99 Small (220 cal), they are an excellent lower-calorie alternative to shakes or MooLattés while still delivering a satisfying, flavorful cold drink. See all DQ drink options on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>All Three DQ Smoothie Flavors</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Flavor</th><th>Small Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strawberry Banana</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~220</td><td>Most popular — classic sweet-tart fruit combo</td></tr><tr><td>Mango Pineapple</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~240</td><td>Tropical, bright, great for summer</td></tr><tr><td>Triple Berry</td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>~220</td><td>Mixed berry blend — slightly tart</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>DQ Smoothie vs. Misty Slush vs. Shake</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Fruit Smoothie (Small, $3.99, ~220 cal)</strong> — Thick, real fruit, no dairy. Best for fruit lovers who want a filling drink without dairy.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush (Small, $2.39, ~150 cal)</a></strong> — Lighter, icy slush texture, lower calorie. Best for guests who want something refreshing and inexpensive.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="/items/chocolate-shake">Chocolate Shake (Small, $3.49, ~710 cal)</a></strong> — Thick, dairy-based, high-calorie. Best for guests who want dessert in a cup.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Dairy-Free Option</h2>
  <p>DQ Fruit Smoothies do not contain dairy — they are made with fruit purees and base ingredients. Guests who are lactose intolerant or avoiding dairy can enjoy smoothies as an alternative to shakes or Blizzards. Always confirm with your specific location if cross-contamination is a concern.</p>

